---
title: "03 — Company Onboarding (proposed; solid = MVP; async steps via durable workflow)"
---
%% Legend: participant order = trust order; founder input untrusted until validated.
%% Req IDs: COMP-001/002/003, NFR-005. MVP provisioning = workspace/profile/docs only (no code/hosting).
sequenceDiagram
  actor F as Founder [untrusted]
  participant A as api (Account & Company)
  participant W as Workflow coordinator (async)
  participant D as Discovery module
  participant ACT as Activity feed

  F->>A: Create company (mode: idea | suggested | existing) + brief
  A->>A: validate, persist draft (tenant stamped)
  A->>W: enqueue provisioning workflow (durable, resumable)
  A-->>F: company created (state: onboarding)
  loop each provisioning step (checkpointed)
    W->>W: execute step (profile, mission draft, research area, roadmap area, docs, activity)
    W->>ACT: ordered, timestamped step event (COMP-003)
    ACT-->>F: SSE progress (honest, no fake success)
  end
  alt step fails
    W->>ACT: explicit failed state + reason + retry control
  end
  W->>A: onboarding complete
  A->>D: unlock interview (state: active)
  D-->>F: interview begins (DISC-001)
